 "name": "Normality test online: Jarque-Bera, Shapiro-Wilk, Kolmogorov",
 "alternateName": "Test de normalité en ligne : Jarque-Bera, Shapiro-Wilk, Kolmogorov",
 "description": "Normal or not? With 100 values drawn from a normal law, all three tests say “compatible” (Jarque-Bera p = 0.30, Shapiro-Wilk p = 0.24); a single point added 4.2 standard deviations from the mean is enough to reject normality.",
